      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00ba29c1b77e19afeef0875a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どうしたの？代わろうか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "74de1b297de8b8585ec9ac8986af7c034e69a927f7b8a25c146fbdf59441f2b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77fbdd32511e58d3287c4aed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ごめ～ん～痛いよね～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97481a8e5feed836d402670d477d872c51c443251546478fe8e482b45f2df12d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc6efc642ddace01147ff11b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "はっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd64f4a5b653f7f2d0a46a7face8239f04bafad1cb2dabfd4404ed16d78ec5a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc6b8917188991aec4d1d41d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明日はこれだって。楽しみだね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9601230d9eb91834c7ead305cc18569bf05c5d77d8b6ca3df77095e18f86d5ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0d0fd179580b5f99d0d1c13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『やれる…私はやれる…』\r\nこの程度の疲れなら、まだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e16e55417c6dccd2e6c6c0dd3d57433b2c696878d9ca51dfd14ac175486557f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c491a078062595fce23a479d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この状態でのトレーニングは\r\n効果的とは言えないかも…。\r\n休養を挟むのはどうかな？",
      "source_fingerprint": "759d009939249296da9126bc042247727c844afe6966c1f3692040105d527e63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfb7779e82315c2f53434e71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『私は最高の成果を上げる！』\r\n…よし、始めよう！\r\nいいトレーニングができそうだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "93f26a759d30629f446ef09fe7746a8e05f6ea6b29304776db5b6a8e84a55c9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:783e0e3838619f7a141cd107",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うん、わかる。今日はやれる！\r\n期待してくれていいよ、\r\nトレーナーさん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e9ca234ea4b6c0a3872528bb004a9e9070371a6206c274253c96e2b03bf3e76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc8c4c4cbbd84c9b0eccbe6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーニングあるのみ！だよね。\r\n基礎を大事に積み重ねていくのが、\r\n1番の近道だ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dba938199d11082234a01a09483639a1a9a0aefa8bc7ad9a4d3bc3b73588ef0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39222de9acaa55f071653c18",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今ごろ幼馴染のみんなもどこかで\r\n頑張ってるんだろうな…。\r\nふふっ、負けられないね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c91a97c65f738a0d20f852cd7c1dc88ca4ff5e5ad70b79e9dab2e26c24d382fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cea0cffd24bfb900da98e836",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "準備はできてるよ。\r\nいい感じにリラックスできてる。\r\nさあ、やろうか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "354a8a03fb52ebee84c83cb063713c3486747721dfeda34cb79d0f8c592e3f3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "20006"
      ]
    }
